          "docs": "<p>Retrieves a fresh set of credentials for use when uploading a new set of game build files to Amazon GameLift's Amazon S3. This is done as part of the build creation process; see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/gamelift/latest/apireference/API_CreateBuild.html\">GameSession</a>.</p> <p>To request new credentials, specify the build ID as returned with an initial <code>CreateBuild</code> request. If successful, a new set of credentials are returned, along with the S3 storage location associa"
